      }
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ This kill requires being on a Co-op slayer assignment",
      "location": {
        "start": 164484,
        "end": 164606
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164606,
        "end": 164607
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• To do this it is recommended to both get the task individually and then join a social slayer group by using an enchanted gem on the other person.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164607,
        "end": 164768
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164768,
        "end": 164769
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ After getting the task, both go to the legio you wish to kill, and have one person enter. The other will get a popup asking if they want to join.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164769,
        "end": 164923
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164923,
        "end": 164924
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Quickly kill the spawned legio, and then you can setup for the 1t kill, bring multiple keys and dummies to do multiple attempts in the instance.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164924,
        "end": 165077
      }
